# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this the tarball's contents depend on who checked the repository out:
# a Windows checkout converts to CRLF, which adds one byte per line to every text
# file that ships and moved `check:size` by 337 bytes. The budget in
# scripts/check-size.mjs is meaningless if it measures a different artifact on
# each platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything binary that shows up later must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.wasm binary
